            <ArticleTitle>First Complete Genome Sequence of Haemophilus influenzae Serotype a.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01506-16</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01506-16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Haemophilus influenzae is an important human pathogen that primarily infects small children. In recent years, H. influenzae serotype a has emerged as a significant cause of invasive disease among indigenous populations. Here, we present the first complete whole-genome sequence of H. influenzae serotype a.</AbstractText>
